<title>USA: F&amp;M Bancorp buys Green County Bank.</title>
<headline>F&amp;M Bancorp buys Green County Bank.</headline>
<dateline>KAUKAUNA, Wis. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>F&amp;M Bancorp Inc, a multibank holding company, on Thursday said it completed the acquisition of  Green County Bank in Brodhead, Wisconsin.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction, which adds assets of $30 million to F&amp;M Bancorp, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
